    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Allen & Jacobs is delighted to present this lovely, own door ground floor apartment, providing well-proportioned light filled accommodation, spanning c.52 sqm/560sqft, the property enjoys a dual aspect, complemented by a south easterly orientated sit-out terrace to the rear, overlooking the water fountain set within the beautifully landscaped communal gardens.\n\nMerrion Grove is conveniently located just off the Stillorgan Road (N11), close to Booterstown, Mount Merrion, Blackrock and Stillorgan, with every conceivable amenity nearby including shops, cafes and restaurants. UCD Belfield is within walking distance while public transport is well catered for with Booterstown DART station, the Aircoach, QBC bus routes that include the E1, E2 and S6. The M50 is also within easy reach. There is an excellent choice of primary & secondary schools close by including St Andrew`s, Mount Anville, St Michael`s College, Sion Hill, Coláiste Íosagáin, Blackrock College and The Teresian School.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, understairs storage room, living room, separate kitchen, bathroom and double bedroom.\n\nAt a Glance\nSpacious own door ground floor apartment\nSit out south easterly terrace \nOverlooking the water fountain within the landscaped gardens\nDual aspect\nAmple Parking\nLarge storage room\nDouble-glazed windows\nElectric heating\nSeparate kitchen\nExtensive use of timber floors\nBeside UCD & QBC\nClose to all amenities\nClose to Booterstown Dart\nEasy reach to city centre.\n\nAccommodation:\nEntrance hall: 1.3m x 1.3m\nStorage room: 2.1m x 1.2m\nLiving room: 4m x 4m\nKitchen: 2.9m x 2m\nBedroom: 3m x 2.9m\nBathroom: 2.9m x 1.8m\nSit out terrace: 4.1m x 1.9m\n\nOutside\nA south easterly orientated sit out patio accessed from the living room. Landscaped communal gardens with ample parking for residents.\n\nService charge:\nWe have been informed that the service charge is 1,415 per annum.\n\nViewing\nStrictly by prior appointment only with sole agents\nAllen & Jacobs\n107 Fosters Avenue\nMount Merrion, Co. Dublin\nt : 2100360 e : info@allenandjacobs.ie\nw : allenandjacobs.ie\n"
      },
